---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="互動解剖圖鑑 | 臨床門診 3D 衛教系統 - 黃冠智醫師" 
  description="專為門診解說與病患衛教打造的 3D 互動人體解剖圖鑑。涵蓋肝臟 Couinaud 8 分段、門脈與肝靜脈系統、胃鏡視野與大腸鏡腸段解剖。"
>
  <div class="anatomy-hub-wrapper">
    <!-- Hero Banner -->
    <div class="hub-hero">
      <div class="hub-badge-row">
        <span class="hub-badge">
          <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M12 2v20M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6"/></svg>
          臨床 3D 衛教與解剖專區
        </span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="hub-title">互動解剖圖鑑</h1>
      <p class="hub-subtitle">
        專為肝膽腸胃門診解說、胃腸鏡檢查與病患溝通打造的 3D 空間解剖圖鑑。直覺探索人體器官分段、血管供應與超音波掃描切面。
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Organ Cards Grid -->
    <div class="organ-grid">
      
      <!-- 1. 肝臟 (已就緒) -->
      <a href="/anatomy/liver" class="organ-card organ-active">
        <div class="card-status-badge status-ready">
          <span class="status-dot"></span>
          3D 互動已就緒
        </div>
        <div class="organ-icon-box" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.15), rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.2)); color: #f97316;">
          <svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M19 14c1.49-1.46 3-3.21 3-5.5A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 16.5 3c-1.76 0-3 .5-4.5 2-1.5-1.5-2.74-2-4.5-2A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 2 8.5c0 2.3 1.5 4.05 3 5.5l7 7Z"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="organ-info">
          <div class="organ-header-group">
            <h2 class="organ-name">肝臟 (Liver)</h2>
            <span class="organ-latin">Hepar · Couinaud Segmentation</span>
          </div>
          <p class="organ-desc">
            教科書標準 3D 模型，詳細展示 Couinaud 8 個分段、3 條縱向肝靜脈裂隙（R, M, L）與橫向門靜脈樹（PV）之臨床劃分標準與超音波指引。
          </p>
          <div class="organ-tags">
            <span class="tag">Couinaud 8分段</span>
            <span class="tag">門脈系統 (PV)</span>
            <span class="tag">肝靜脈 (HV)</span>
            <span class="tag">超音波標準切面</span>
            <span class="tag">360° 自由旋轉</span>
          </div>
          <div class="card-action-link">
            <span>開啟 3D 肝臟解剖系統</span>
            <svg width="16" height="16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
          </div>
        </div>
      </a>

      <!-- 2. 胃部與食道 (已就緒) -->
      <a href="/anatomy/stomach" class="organ-card organ-active">
        <div class="card-status-badge status-ready">
          <span class="status-dot"></span>
          3D 互動已就緒
        </div>
        <div class="organ-icon-box" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.15), rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.2)); color: #38bdf8;">
          <svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M12 2C6.5 2 3 6.5 3 12c0 3.5 2.5 7 5.5 8.5 2 .8 4.5.5 6-.5 2-1.5 3-4 3.5-7.5.5-3.5-2-10.5-6-10.5Z"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="organ-info">
          <div class="organ-header-group">
            <h2 class="organ-name">胃部與食道 (Stomach & Esophagus)</h2>
            <span class="organ-latin">Gaster · Endoscopic Rugae Navigation</span>
          </div>
          <p class="organ-desc">
            內部胃黏膜皺襞（Rugae）剖切模型，整合胃鏡進鏡深度（0~65cm）、J-turn 倒轉視野、胃食道逆流、潰瘍、息肉與腸化生標記。
          </p>
          <div class="organ-tags">
            <span class="tag">內部胃皺襞 (Rugae 剖面)</span>
            <span class="tag">胃鏡巡航 (0~65cm)</span>
            <span class="tag">J-turn 胃底倒轉</span>
            <span class="tag">胃食道逆流 (GERD)</span>
            <span class="tag">消化性潰瘍 / 腸化生</span>
          </div>
          <div class="card-action-link">
            <span>開啟 3D 胃鏡解剖系統</span>
            <svg width="16" height="16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
          </div>
        </div>
      </a>

      <!-- 3. 大腸與直腸 (已就緒) -->
      <a href="/anatomy/colon" class="organ-card organ-active">
        <div class="card-status-badge status-ready">
          <span class="status-dot"></span>
          3D 互動已就緒
        </div>
        <div class="organ-icon-box" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.15), rgba(5, 150, 105, 0.2)); color: #10b981;">
          <svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M4 14c0 3.5 3 6 8 6s8-2.5 8-6-3-6-8-6-8 2.5-8 6Z"/>
            <path d="M6 10V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v4"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="organ-info">
          <div class="organ-header-group">
            <h2 class="organ-name">大腸與直腸 (Colon & Rectum)</h2>
            <span class="organ-latin">Colon · Endoscopic Navigation</span>
          </div>
          <p class="organ-desc">
            3D 結腸袋實體模型，整合大腸鏡進鏡深度巡航（0~100cm）、大腸息肉（SSA/腺瘤）、憩室與痔瘡病灶標記及退鏡衛教。
          </p>
          <div class="organ-tags">
            <span class="tag">大腸鏡進鏡路徑 (0~100cm)</span>
            <span class="tag">大腸息肉標記 (EMR)</span>
            <span class="tag">大腸憩室</span>
            <span class="tag">痔瘡齒狀線</span>
            <span class="tag">結腸袋構造</span>
          </div>
          <div class="card-action-link">
            <span>開啟 3D 大腸鏡解剖系統</span>
            <svg width="16" height="16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
          </div>
        </div>
      </a>

      <!-- 4. 肝膽胰與十二指腸系統 (已就緒) -->
      <a href="/anatomy/biliary-pancreas" class="organ-card organ-active">
        <div class="card-status-badge status-ready">
          <span class="status-dot"></span>
          3D 互動已就緒
        </div>
        <div class="organ-icon-box" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(234, 179, 8, 0.15), rgba(202, 138, 4, 0.2)); color: #eab308;">
          <svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M12 2C8 2 6 6 6 11c0 5 3 9 6 11 3-2 6-6 6-11 0-5-2-9-6-9Z"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="organ-info">
          <div class="organ-header-group">
            <h2 class="organ-name">肝膽胰與十二指腸 (Biliary & Pancreas)</h2>
            <span class="organ-latin">Vesica biliaris · Pancreas · Duodenum</span>
          </div>
          <p class="organ-desc">
            教科書級 3D 實體模型：涵蓋肝臟、膽囊、左右肝管、總膽管 (CBD)、主胰管 (Wirsung)、十二指腸壺腹 (Ampulla of Vater) 與膽結石/胰臟炎標記。
          </p>
          <div class="organ-tags">
            <span class="tag">總膽管 (CBD)</span>
            <span class="tag">主胰管 (Wirsung)</span>
            <span class="tag">十二指腸壺腹</span>
            <span class="tag">膽囊結石 / 息肉</span>
            <span class="tag">急性胰臟炎 / 胰頭腫瘤</span>
          </div>
          <div class="card-action-link">
            <span>開啟 3D 肝膽胰解剖系統</span>
            <svg width="16" height="16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
          </div>
        </div>
      </a>

      <!-- 5. 腹痛九宮格與臨床鑑別診斷系統 (已就緒) -->
      <a href="/anatomy/abdominal-pain" class="organ-card organ-active">
        <div class="card-status-badge status-ready">
          <span class="status-dot"></span>
          3D + 2D 雙模式已就緒
        </div>
        <div class="organ-icon-box" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.15), rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.2)); color: #00e5ff;">
          <svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <rect x="3" y="3" width="7" height="7"/>
            <rect x="14" y="3" width="7" height="7"/>
            <rect x="14" y="14" width="7" height="7"/>
            <rect x="3" y="14" width="7" height="7"/>
            <path d="M10 6.5h4M6.5 10v4M17.5 10v4M10 17.5h4"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="organ-info">
          <div class="organ-header-group">
            <h2 class="organ-name">腹痛九宮格與對應器官 (9-Region Pain Mapping)</h2>
            <span class="organ-latin">Regiones abdominis · Differential Diagnosis</span>
          </div>
          <p class="organ-desc">
            以臨床鑑別為核心的腹痛九宮格診斷系統：整合 3D 臟器透視與 2D 觸控速查盤，涵蓋 9 大區位急重症紅旗警訊、常見疾病鑑別診斷、第一線檢查 Workup 與門診英文病歷片語。
          </p>
          <div class="organ-tags">
            <span class="tag">3D/2D 雙模式</span>
            <span class="tag">9大腹痛分區</span>
            <span class="tag">急重症紅旗警訊</span>
            <span class="tag">黃金鑑別診斷</span>
            <span class="tag">檢查路徑 Workup</span>
            <span class="tag">門診 SOAP 片語</span>
          </div>
          <div class="card-action-link">
            <span>開啟腹痛九宮格臨床系統</span>
            <svg width="16" height="16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
          </div>
        </div>
      </a>

    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .anatomy-hub-wrapper {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 2.5rem 1.5rem 4rem;
  }

  /* Hero Banner */
  .hub-hero {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 780px;
    margin: 0 auto 3rem;
  }

  .hub-badge-row {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .hub-badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    padding: 0.35rem 0.85rem;
    border-radius: 9999px;
    background: rgba(74, 144, 164, 0.12);
    border: 1px solid rgba(74, 144, 164, 0.3);
    color: var(--color-primary);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .hub-title {
    font-size: 2.25rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: #1e293b;
    margin-bottom: 0.85rem;
  }

  .hub-subtitle {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: #64748b;
  }

  /* Organ Grid */
  .organ-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(350px, 1fr));
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  /* Organ Card */
  .organ-card {
    background: #ffffff;
    border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    border-radius: 20px;
    padding: 1.75rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    position: relative;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.03);
    transition: all 0.25s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
  }

  .organ-active:hover {
    border-color: #38bdf8;
    box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.15);
    transform: translateY(-3px);
  }

  .organ-pending {
    opacity: 0.85;
    background: #f8fafc;
    border-style: dashed;
  }

  .card-status-badge {
    position: absolute;
    top: 1.25rem;
    right: 1.25rem;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    padding: 0.25rem 0.6rem;
    border-radius: 6px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.35rem;
  }

  .status-ready {
    background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.12);
    color: #059669;
    border: 1px solid rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.3);
  }

  .status-dot {
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #10b981;
    box-shadow: 0 0 6px #10b981;
  }

  .status-soon {
    background: #e2e8f0;
    color: #64748b;
  }

  .organ-icon-box {
    width: 60px;
    height: 60px;
    border-radius: 16px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .organ-header-group {
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
  }

  .organ-name {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #0f172a;
    margin-bottom: 0.15rem;
  }

  .organ-latin {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: #94a3b8;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .organ-desc {
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: #475569;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    flex: 1;
  }

  .organ-tags {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .tag {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    padding: 0.2rem 0.55rem;
    border-radius: 6px;
    background: #f1f5f9;
    color: #475569;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .card-action-link {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #0284c7;
    padding-top: 1rem;
    border-top: 1px solid #f1f5f9;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .hub-title {
      font-size: 1.75rem;
    }
    .organ-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
